{1}{Sorry to interrupt, but it seems Joachim has discovered something...these individuals [He motions to the corpses on the ground.] seem to be a part of some larger plot.  A plot against YOU...}{Sorry to interrupt, but it seems Joachim has discovered something...these individuals [He motions to the corpses on the ground.] seem to be a part of some larger plot.  A plot against YOU...}{}{1}{}{gf2301 1}
